Cloudflare Workers AI and Ollama are separate services; this distribution contains
no model weights, upstream credentials, accounts or inference provider substitutes.
Provider service terms and model licenses must be reviewed by the operator.

Third-party Python/OS software remains under its respective licenses. Release
verification generates an actual-image package/license inventory and CycloneDX
SBOM. See docs/release/verification.md and scripts/security_gates.py. Optional
Streamlit dependencies are not included in the default headless image.

The Streamlit 1.66.1 wheel omits its license file. Its Apache-2.0 license is
supplemented verbatim from the official release tag under third-party-licenses
in the image (gateway/third_party_licenses in the wheel). licenses/manifest.json
records the source URL and checksum. This text is included in the actual-image
license inventory; no missing-license finding is waived.
